# Domain-level 301 redirect: old domain -> new primary domain
# Preserves path/query via :splat. Netlify treats a "from" that includes a
# hostname as a domain-level redirect, so this fires for any request that
# arrives on pianafootballconsultant.com, regardless of which page it hits.
https://pianafootballconsultant.com/* https://pianafootballconsultancy.com/:splat 301!
